## Web Frontend Architecture

### Component Tree

```
page.tsx (state management, API calls)
├── AnimatedOrbs (background effects)
├── Sidebar
│   ├── Upload button (POST /upload)
│   ├── Schema browser (expandable per table)
│   ├── Relationship list
│   ├── Sample queries (dynamic)
│   └── Health status indicator
└── Chat area
    ├── WelcomeHero (when no messages)
    ├── ChatMessage[] (animated, per message)
    │   ├── User bubble (right-aligned, gradient)
    │   ├── Bot bubble (left-aligned, glassmorphism)
    │   ├── MLInsightBanner (anomaly/forecast/cluster)
    │   ├── ResultChart (auto-select by intent)
    │   ├── DataTable (paginated, ML-highlighted)
    │   ├── ExpandableSection → SQL
    │   └── ExpandableSection → Explanation
    └── ChatInput
        ├── Quick-action pills (Forecast/Anomaly/Cluster/Top10)
        └── Auto-growing textarea + animated send button
```

